<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian NAL Merchant Bank splits shares.</title>
<headline>Nigerian NAL Merchant Bank splits shares.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's NAL Merchant Bank  on Friday announced  a scrip issue of three new shares for two.</p>
<p>It also declared a dividend of 40 kobo per share for the year ended  March 31, 1997 the same dividend as last year.</p>
<p>Shares closed 43 kobo higher at 9.18 naira on the news.</p>
<p>NAL said on Thursday it posted 389.6 million naira in after-tax profits  for the year against 203 million naira a year earlier.</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
